        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-STRSHPRO316LPHFLU1250, Modern Fluted Customizable Ladder Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Doorware Design modern fluted door pull is completely customizable. Choose from several different sizes ranging from 12 inch to 60 inch overall lengths. The stem mounts with end caps and the fluted grip separate pieces fitted together to order so you can choose any combination of finishes that suits your style. The fluted texture has maximum design impact and will give your main entry the wow factor it deserves. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Design Modern Fluted Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 316 Marine Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU121250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU181250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU241250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU361250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU481250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPHFLU601250:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-PullFinish3.jpg?v=1774586591\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
